            <div class="intention"><strong>Today:</strong> you'll tell the story of a real event so strange it sounds invented — a plague not of illness but of dancing — and you'll master the passive voice, the structure English reaches for whenever things are done <em>to</em> people and the person responsible is unknown, unimportant, or best left unnamed.</div>

