                <div class="meaning"><b>compulsively</b> (adv) — in a way that is impossible to stop or control, driven by an urge stronger than the will.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="guess-item">
                <div class="sent">2. What began with one woman soon <b>seized</b> dozens more, with fresh cases appearing across the city day after day.</div>
